on exitFrame
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 1 ............................... whatodoeveryframe()
  [  4] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [  7] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 10] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 30>
  [ 12] pushint8 299 ............................ <299>
  [ 15] gt ...................................... <the locV of sprite 30 > 299>
  [ 16] jmpifz [ 34] ............................ if the locV of sprite 30 > 299 then / else
  [ 19] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 22] pusharglist 1 ........................... <34>
  [ 24] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(34)>
  [ 27] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 28] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(34).visible = 0
  [ 31] jmp [ 48]
  [ 34] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 37] pusharglist 1 ........................... <34>
  [ 39] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(34)>
  [ 42] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 45] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(34).visible = 1
  [ 48] ret
end
